- Strictly prohibited to run any git command without human approval
- Prefer merge over rebase
- Every new to-be-developed features must live in the new branch and the scope should be defined by [2_CURRENT_TASK.md](mdc:docs/workflow/2_CURRENT_TASK.md) document 
- Every feature-branch should be merged into 'develop' branch when the Flow is finished accordin to [0_WORKFLOW_RULES.md](mdc:docs/workflow/0_WORKFLOW_RULES.md)
- Version upgrade and release building should be done from the 'release' branch for the Google Play store version with postfix 'g'